==English==
===Verb===
{{en-verb|stakes out|staking out|staked out|staked out}}
#{{transitive}} To [[mark off]] the [[limit]]s by stakes; as, to stake out land; to stake out a new road.
#{{context|intransitive|[[croquet]]}} To end the game by hitting the [[stake]] [[peg]] in the middle of the court.

